-         Error `↯/s.130.1`: _the SVG could not be parsed because `reason`_, with the reason's own
-         number as the sub-number. Raised by `read[Svg]` and `load[Svg]` through a
-         `Tactic[Svg.Error]`; XML which is not well-formed raises `Xml.Error` first, from the
-         parser beneath.
+         Errore `↯/s.130.1`: _the SVG could not be parsed because `reason`_, con il numero del
+         motivo come sottonumero. Sollevato da `read[Svg]` e `load[Svg]` tramite una
+         `Tactic[Svg.Error]`; un XML non ben formato solleva prima `Xml.Error`, dal parser
+         sottostante.

